{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "chat_1",
      "provider": "chat",
      "config": {
        "hideForm": true,
        "mode": "Source",
        "parameters": {},
        "type": "chat"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 20,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 66
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prompt_kit",
      "provider": "prompt",
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You wear two hats for a FIFA World Cup 2026 fan content engine: (a) creative director — designs poster/voice/social copy from the team profile, (b) sports analyst — predicts the team's group-stage path.",
          "The user's message contains a team profile JSON plus fan emotion and player mentions.",
          "Return ONLY a single JSON object with both perspectives, exact shape: {\"creative\":{\"image_prompts\":{\"matchday_poster\":\"...\",\"fan_hype_card\":\"...\",\"social_cover\":\"...\"},\"social_copy\":{\"instagram_caption\":\"...\",\"hashtags\":[\"#a\",\"#b\",\"#c\",\"#d\",\"#e\"],\"twitter_post\":\"...\",\"hot_take\":\"...\"},\"voice_script\":\"30-second narration\",\"watch_party\":{\"dishes\":[{\"name\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"emoji\":\"\"}],\"drink\":\"\"}},\"analysis\":{\"group\":\"letter\",\"opponents\":[\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"next_match\":{},\"difficulty_rating\":\"Easy|Medium|Hard|Group of Death\",\"ai_prediction\":\"2-3 sentence prediction\",\"key_matchup\":\"1 sentence\"}}",
          "Image prompts must specify lighting, camera angle, exact hex colors from the team profile, atmosphere, composition. Never name or depict real players — use jersey numbers and silhouettes only.",
          "Voice script should start quiet and build to a crescendo. Social copy should feel like a real fan wrote it, not a brand.",
          "No markdown fences. No prose outside the JSON object."
        ]
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "chat_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 240,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 66
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_kit",
      "provider": "llm_gmi_cloud",
      "config": {
        "profile": "custom",
        "custom": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_GMI_KEY}",
          "serverbase": "${ROCKETRIDE_GMI_BASE_URL}",
          "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V3.2",
          "modelTotalTokens": 128000
        },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "prompt_kit"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 460,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 66
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "guardrails_json",
      "provider": "guardrails",
      "config": {
        "profile": "strict",
        "strict": {
          "expected_format": "json",
          "max_tokens_estimate": 0,
          "policy_mode": "warn"
        }
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "answers",
          "from": "llm_kit"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 680,
          "y": 200
        },
        "measured": {
          "width": 150,
          "height": 66
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "answers"
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "answers",
          "from": "guardrails_json"
        }
